ood provide protective benefits for breast health, but getting all of these nutrients from our daily diet can be difficult, so we created Protective Breast Formula dietary supplement to make it simple."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"A portion of the proceeds from the sale of this product will be donated to support women's health research."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"This statement has not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Christine Hroner, M.D.\r\nChristine Horner, M.D., FACS, is an expert in the field of women's breast health and has been a health activist for more than 20 years. She has done significant research into key nutritional and lifestyle interventions proven to promote breast health. Dr. Horner created this exceptional formula, based on her expertise in this field, and in collaboration with Nature's Way.\r\nIn her book, Waking the Warrior Goddess, Dr. Horner identifies five critical keys for breast health, upon which the Protective Breast Formula is based. The key ingredients in this formula provide a vital foundation for breast health."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Women (not pregnant or lactating)","Gluten Free","Dairy Free"],"thumbnail":"328035_thumbnail.jpg","upcSku":"7 63948 05886 0","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}